 style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:95.4545%; background-color:#27c429; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 4.5455%); display:inline-block;\">105%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Drown\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Drown <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Drowning Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Drowning_Icon_Big_f65e47.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:90.9091%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 9.0909%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:90.9091%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 9.0909%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Venore, by clicking on a painting <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33000,32034,4\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33000, 32034, 4)</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tBlight Mariner attacks in melee range.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tWhen you enter the room, you’ll first face three Drowned Deck Hands, while the <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Blight Mariner</strong> waits on the ship in the northwest corner. Focus on killing the Deck Hands as quickly as possible—any damage dealt to the Blight Mariner while they are alive will instead heal him for <b>5000 HP</b>.  \n</p><p>After about 10–15 seconds, the Blight Mariner will join the fight. If the Deck Hands are still alive, ignore the boss and continue killing them first. Once they’re defeated, switch to the Blight Mariner. You’ll only have a short window to damage him before he retreats back to the ship and summons three new Deck Hands. At this stage, stationary Blight Spitters will also begin spawning. These deal ranged damage but can mostly be ignored, as they don’t directly affect the boss fight.  \n</p><p>To minimize damage from the Blight Spitters, try to keep the Blight Mariner in the northern part of the room. Each cycle, more Blight Spitters will appear, so positioning becomes increasingly important.  \n</p><p><b>Tip:</b> If you use hotkeys with the Battle List, consider sorting it in descending order by name. This will place the Drowned Deck Hands at the top and the Blight Mariner at the bottom, reducing the risk of accidentally targeting the boss too early.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 336 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 50 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</